A '''Seashine''' is a [[Critter]] that can be [[Hunting|Hunted]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''Seashine''' has a {{Green|25%}} chance to spawn from an [[Exploding Lily Pad]].

== Behavior ==
'''Seashines''' swim around in water. If the player throws a {{Item|Medium Fishing Net}} or better at it, it teleports {{Green|2}} blocks away in a random direction and applies {{PotN|Blindness}} for {{Green|2}} seconds. The {{Stat|Damage}} dealt is based on the player's {{Stat|Pull}} stat.

